{"id":"a5f0372880e1fccb","group":"92","path":"92/92-cor-godel-truth.md","title":"Gödel Sentence True","display":"cor-godel-truth — Gödel Sentence True","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-cor-godel-truth","aliases":["92-cor-godel-truth"],"display":"cor-godel-truth — Gödel Sentence True","depends_on":["[[92-df-godel-sentence]]","[[92-df-standard-model]]","[[92-df-sound-system]]","[[92-df-provability-predicate]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-cor-godel-truth"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-cor-godel-truth</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-godel-truth — Gödel Sentence True"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b823f18a7fc28400\" href=\"?note=b823f18a7fc28400\" title=\"92-df-godel-sentence\">92-df-godel-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ccb738ae4bbf923c\" href=\"?note=ccb738ae4bbf923c\" title=\"92-df-standard-model\">92-df-standard-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d76d3a84b374975c\" href=\"?note=d76d3a84b374975c\" title=\"92-df-sound-system\">92-df-sound-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e9cc91aaee998c7b\" href=\"?note=e9cc91aaee998c7b\" title=\"92-df-provability-predicate\">92-df-provability-predicate</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GdlSent}_G(\\gamma)\">\\(\\mathrm{GdlSent}_G(\\gamma)\\)</span> (Gödel-sentence predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b823f18a7fc28400\" href=\"?note=b823f18a7fc28400\" title=\"92-df-godel-sentence\">92-df-godel-sentence</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sound}(G)\">\\(\\mathrm{Sound}(G)\\)</span> (standard arithmetic soundness, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d76d3a84b374975c\" href=\"?note=d76d3a84b374975c\" title=\"92-df-sound-system\">92-df-sound-system</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak N_G\">\\(\\mathfrak N_G\\)</span> (standard arithmetic structure)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}godel\\text{-}truth}\\vdash\n\\forall\\gamma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Sound}(G)\\land\\mathrm{GdlSent}_G(\\gamma)\\bigr)\n\\Longrightarrow\\mathfrak N_G\\models\\gamma\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}godel\\text{-}truth}\\vdash\n\\forall\\gamma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Sound}(G)\\land\\mathrm{GdlSent}_G(\\gamma)\\bigr)\n\\Longrightarrow\\mathfrak N_G\\models\\gamma\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_G\">\\(\\varphi_G\\)</span> : Gödel句子</li>\n<li>本推论对当前仅以“<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>可证固定点等价”定义的<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GdlSent}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{GdlSent}_G\\)</span>采用算术可靠性：它保证该等价在标准模型中成立，并排除一个已证明却声称自己无证明的句子</li>\n<li>对由标准对角构造得到的规范Gödel句，可把假设细分并降到普通相容性加上证明谓词的标准模型正确性及固定点构造的外部可靠性；裸写<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\land\\mathrm{GdlSent}_G(\\gamma)\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\land\\mathrm{GdlSent}_G(\\gamma)\\)</span>不足以覆盖任意不可靠系统</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>一致性经典上用于排除Gödel句否定的可证性，与这里只断言标准真值的问题应分开</li>\n<li>这是&quot;真但不可证&quot;的核心意义</li>\n<li>展示了真理与可证性的分离</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-godel-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"b823f18a7fc28400","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-godel-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-standard-model","status":"resolved","id":"ccb738ae4bbf923c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-standard-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-sound-system","status":"resolved","id":"d76d3a84b374975c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-sound-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-provability-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"e9cc91aaee998c7b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-provability-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-godel-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"b823f18a7fc28400","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{GdlSent}_G(\\gamma)$ (Gödel-sentence predicate, see [[92-df-godel-sentence]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-sound-system","status":"resolved","id":"d76d3a84b374975c","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Sound}(G)$ (standard arithmetic soundness, see [[92-df-sound-system]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{GdlSent}_G(\\gamma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sound}(G)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak N_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}godel\\text{-}truth}\\vdash\n\\forall\\gamma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Sound}(G)\\land\\mathrm{GdlSent}_G(\\gamma)\\bigr)\n\\Longrightarrow\\mathfrak N_G\\models\\gamma","display":true},{"tex":"\\varphi_G","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GdlSent}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\land\\mathrm{GdlSent}_G(\\gamma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false}],"bytes":1552,"backlinks":[{"id":"baf256d78d60c2a6","anchor":"ref-36","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-cor-godel-truth]]"}],"outgoing":["b823f18a7fc28400","ccb738ae4bbf923c","d76d3a84b374975c","e9cc91aaee998c7b"]}